<title>USA: Orion Capital raises payout, sets buybacks.</title>
<headline>Orion Capital raises payout, sets buybacks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orion Capital Corp said Friday directors declared a quarterly dividend of $0.28 per share, which represents a 12 percent increase over the previous rate of $0.25 per share, and authorized additional share repurchases.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on January 2, to shareholders of record on December 16, the company said.</p>
<p>Orion Capital said the board also authorized an additional amount of up to $5 million for repurchases of the company's common stock, increasing remaining authorization to $5,495,000. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
